    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n24712" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">δια-δῐκέω</span></b>  (A), <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>contend at law,</i>
			
